


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_7ad94a48:


    "厨房里充满甜美的香味。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_179d369c:


    "因为阳菜说想学着自己做巧克力，现在正在给她上课教她如何做。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_3c303e23:


    "这当然是靠着恋人的特权才能约到预约很火的文老师来亲自指导。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_87a4510e:


    "讲义内容是做一个简单的生巧克力。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_d9c1f9b5:


    "基本上就是用沸水融开巧克力材料后再固定形状，但实际上这个操作还蛮需要花功夫的。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_251ddbc9:


    "虽然不用像做蛋糕时计算多少克，但也不能像野营时做咖喱饭似的一锅倒。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_2e99c33e:


    "就是用沸水将材料融化到一起，但为了好吃要随时注意好火候，并且需要不停地搅拌。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_49fae690:


    "无论做什么，和文熟练的手法比起来，阳菜的动作都很生涩。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_1919bf7e:


    "第一次挑战做巧克力的阳菜和从小就受到身为点心师的父亲手把手教学的文，肯定会有很大差距。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_a2fed0ab:


    "现在正把搀着糖水的生奶油混到巧克力里去，果然非常难。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_577eb521:


    "在完全变得润滑前，需要按一定的节奏一直搅拌下去。可能是不擅长做这类单调的工作。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_dc6509a5:


    "明明刚才还很开心的削着要扔进沸水里的巧克力板呢。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_903fb4da:



    voice "2HI_0827"
    hina "「怎么都混不起来啊～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_0d32d1af:



    voice "2FU_0694"
    fumi "「要坚持住，只要花时间搅拌，肯定会变得顺滑起来的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_def6cb19:


    "文温柔的鼓励着开始丧气的阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_81c87815:



    voice "2FU_0695"
    fumi "「我来扶着盆，阳菜专心搅拌就行了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_add880c3:


    "阳菜点点头，转动搅拌棒。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_29345c93:



    voice "2HI_0828"
    hina "「不单纯是融掉巧克力再让它变硬回去那么简单的事啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_a4d484a6:



    voice "2FU_0696"
    fumi "「是呢，这次我们是用生巧克力做的，所以会格外再花些功夫。在嘴里融化开时的口感特别好喔♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_309edec5:



    voice "2HI_0829"
    hina "「不止是巧克力，还要把糖水、生奶油还有黄油都放进去，感觉会非常甜，卡路里也会很高吧……小文没问题吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_b03f2260:



    voice "2FU_0697"
    fumi "「在、在探索美食的路上，减肥什么的，都、都是些小事情！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_083d3699:


    "顺便一提这次用的巧克力材料是『考维曲』，是一种可可脂超过百分之三十，具有很高脂肪含量的巧克力。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_a65110d2:



    voice "2HI_0830"
    hina "「哈哈，我妈妈和姐姐也这么说过」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_b7bbcdca:


    "那一家子巨乳。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_40174956:



    voice "2FU_0698"
    fumi "「是、是吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_7abcd2c2:


    "看来值得思考下巧克力和胸部发育的关联性了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_2624eb99:



    voice "2HI_0831"
    hina "「我妈妈和姐姐每年情人节都会做巧克力」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_fca8449a:



    voice "2FU_0699"
    fumi "「我妈妈不会做呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_9f789663:



    voice "2HI_0832"
    hina "「看她们俩做时还觉得很简单呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_75834277:



    voice "2FU_0700"
    fumi "「阳菜的妈妈和姐姐肯定在你没看到的时候做失败过很多次了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_ab262020:



    voice "2HI_0833"
    hina "「小文也失败过？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_8ebaba0b:



    voice "2FU_0701"
    fumi "「肯定啊，都能建个巧克力制的小家了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_ba2c062e:



    voice "2HI_0834"
    hina "「哈哈，那太厉害了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_51a55d10:



    voice "2FU_0702"
    fumi "「所以阳菜也别在意，就算这次失败了也没关系，而且这次也就是练习一下而已」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_49d61ca3:



    voice "2HI_0835"
    hina "「嗯，我知道了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_98527ae1:


    "阳菜得到文的鼓励后，用力握住了搅拌棍。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_555e4f34:



    voice "2HI_0836"
    hina "「搅—拌—起来！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_fa0c498b:



    voice "2FU_0703"
    fumi "「哇不行不行！这么用力搅会—」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_dfcee156:



    voice "2HI_0837"
    hina "「呀！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_d3b30390:


    "文没来得及制止，搅拌棍刮碰到盆壁，溅出了巧克力液。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_d6a0d238:



    voice "2FU_0704"
    fumi "「啊哇哇！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_407ae1f4:


    "盆里的巧克力浆液剧烈地翻滚着，还好盆没跟着翻掉，不然都白忙活了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_d8f1fc7c:


    "文慌忙连带着阳菜一起稳住盆。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_50be30be:



    voice "2FU_0705"
    fumi "「哈哈，好险」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_d4803a3f:


    "看上去没事。巧克力的粘度很高，只从盆里溅出来一点。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_bf18741c:



    voice "2HI_0838"
    hina "「……对不起」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_67932b63:



    voice "2FU_0706"
    fumi "「没事，几乎没溅出来什么，而且就算盆翻了，材料也还有很多呢♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_99e497d7:


    "文安慰起失落的阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_592172e2:



    voice "2HI_0839"
    hina "「抱歉，我这个学徒太笨了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_2f4620ac:



    voice "2FU_0707"
    fumi "「才没有，稍微有些调皮但可是非常可爱的学徒呢♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_ee32be1b:



    voice "2HI_0840"
    hina "「哈哈……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_9a1d324f:



    voice "2FU_0708"
    fumi "「啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_d1d103fe:


    "文盯着阳菜的脸小声叫道。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_12a4c87c:



    voice "2HI_0841"
    hina "「怎么了？我脸上沾到什么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_fc9b2faf:



    voice "2FU_0709"
    fumi "「沾到了，是巧克力」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_b2ec0ff8:



    voice "2HI_0842"
    hina "「真的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_2e75ef0b:



    voice "2FU_0710"
    fumi "「扶好盆喔？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_0a45c0d7:


    "文说着把盆交给阳菜扶着后，空出手来伸向她的脸颊。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_12e760c8:



    voice "2FU_0711"
    fumi "「沾着巧克力的脸蛋看起来好好吃呢，阳菜」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_398430dd:


    "用手指拭去脸上的巧克力后，文笑了笑。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_65d73966:



    voice "2HI_0843"
    hina "「呜，要被咬了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_55133331:



    voice "2FU_0712"
    fumi "「我可舍不得，才不会咬呢。不过会想舔舔」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_d9a0cc45:



    voice "2HI_0844"
    hina "「那倒可以……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_834a2aac:



    voice "2FU_0713"
    fumi "「啊，难得有机会，要不要尝尝看我们做的好不好吃？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_3814d8ff:



    voice "2HI_0845"
    hina "「尝？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_24c08834:



    voice "2FU_0714"
    fumi "「嗯，啊——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_624876c0:


    "文朝着阳菜的嘴伸出沾着巧克力的手指。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_236cc969:



    voice "2HI_0846"
    hina "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_4dcbf72b:


    "阳菜很顺从的探出舌头尝了手指。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_880f9a84:



    voice "2FU_0715"
    fumi "「好吃吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_10c87189:



    voice "2HI_0847"
    hina "「嗯，好甜……嗯啾」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_f71ae713:



    voice "2FU_0716"
    fumi "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_f0abf073:


    "从指尖窜出的电流不禁让文发出了甜美的喘息。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_c64cf942:



    voice "2HI_0848"
    hina "「不知道是巧克力好吃还是小文的手指好吃了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_a80f3b15:



    voice "2FU_0717"
    fumi "「啊哈，我刚刚也该尝尝阳菜脸颊的味道呢，再蹭上去点巧克力好不好」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_b0991ff2:



    voice "2HI_0849"
    hina "「不行啦，固型的巧克力要不够用了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_b9da7776:



    voice "2FU_0718"
    fumi "「没事，还有好多呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_de0ed6cb:



    voice "2HI_0850"
    hina "「你不减肥了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_e17ef22d:



    voice "2FU_0719"
    fumi "「呜……真是的，说这么使坏的话可不像阳菜呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_f9c3ad9c:



    voice "2HI_0851"
    hina "「我没想使坏啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_7e24a3f8:



    voice "2FU_0720"
    fumi "「待、待会儿多多运动下就没事了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_367d09fb:


    "文这么说着从身后抱住阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_f0876e86:



    voice "2HI_0852"
    hina "「一会想去跑跑步吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_1ea0520c:



    voice "2FU_0721"
    fumi "「那个……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_f4e139a8:


    "看来是没理解。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_b0cdc807:



    voice "2RI_0840"
    rin "「那个，不好意思！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_c11be541:


    "从客厅传来伦的声音。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_6bdb8c37:



    voice "2HI_0853"
    hina "「啊，对，还有人在呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_53eb4c04:



    voice "2RI_0841"
    rin "「我一直在呢！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_f23af1fb:


    "虽然火热的场面被制止住了，但阳菜和文比先前更有兴致的继续做起了巧克力。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_b32d4e98:



    voice "2RI_0842"
    rin "「这是做巧克力呢还是撒狗粮呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_6cf4bc3b:


    "伦在客厅一如既往的嘲讽着两人。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_e624f963:



    voice "2RI_0843"
    rin "「虽然说巧克力本来就有强身和媚药的效果，但看来就算没这层效果，这两人啊～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_8e5719c1:


    "就算这么牢骚着，伦看向厨房二人的视线里也是充满暖意的。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_b8c06463:



    voice "2RI_0844"
    rin "「不过，还是希望你们能注意下时间和场合，毕竟我们不是地藏。哎，圣夜夜也说说她俩啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_b8e3f8f1:



    voice "2MI_0821"
    miyako "「哈！我吃不下再多蛋糕了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_01_1f815ab2:


    "瞌睡虫。"
